# NOTE: this file is written and must be read via nitransforms
# (nitransforms.linear.load(path, fmt='fs').matrix), not FreeSurfer's own LTA
# tools -- nitransforms stores LTAs using FreeSurfer's "points convention",
# so the raw matrix numbers above are NOT the intended physical transform
# directly; only round-tripping through nitransforms' reader/writer gives
# back the correct matrix.
# Maps HiP-CT brain native physical space (mm, corner-origin: voxel (0,0,0) ->
